oint anchor."}, :axioms #{}}}, :I2 {:text "    Assertions without anchors are indistinguishable from confabulation. Observers cannot tell if the agent is reporting reality or generating plausible-sounding noise.\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/agent/evidence-over-assertion.flexiarg", :sha256 "28425a05c4a87cbfe3147c1998e83701b8519b42c1796f1d0f25b4b039271248"}, :situation-source "Checkpoint reference fragment.", :theory {:elems #{:i2}, :names {:i2 "Checkpoint 6 of M-stack-stereolithography is cited as the piano-roll precedent."}, :axioms #{}}}, :B {:text "    Require every substantive claim to point to evidence: a file path, a trace event, a test result, a quotation. If evidence is unavailable, emit the claim as provisional with an expiry and a verification path. Make \"unsupported claim\" a detectable violation, not just a style preference.\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/agent/evidence-over-assertion.flexiarg", :sha256 "28425a05c4a87cbfe3147c1998e83701b8519b42c1796f1d0f25b4b039271248"}, :situation-source "Combined pattern and checkpoint reference.", :theory {:elems #{:b}, :names {:b "A trace design with an independently inspectable precedent."}, :axioms #{}}}}, :maps {:a1 #{[:g :i1]}, :a2 #{[:g :i2]}, :b1 #{[:i1 :b]}, :b2 #{[:i2 :b]}}, :auxiliary {:b1 false, :b2 false}}} {:occurrence-id ["war-machine/state-capture" 23], :pattern "war-machine/state-capture", :roles ["action" "context"], :fragment-indices [], :origin :selected, :provenance {:reading-record-id "M-war-machine-wiring/M-war-machine-wiring/policy-2629917c87a61978be8f/[\"war-machine/state-capture\" 23]", :span {:start 1814, :end 1872}, :source-text-digest "bd0f29407a1be7c77a6fb41f33fff97b01e22e9a0b093b4ee693af0197ba9ed4", :analysis-digest "c8402106cd699388b85a9387c851b2a45fd28e0cdf6445524f21fc236efa72a7", :source-sha256 "b45598fb80725dfb4b7deadf520355feaca633dc9d1238c037c7fad654b6d363", :square-digest "ec923c242de9faf0f7d3038371d7f2d38eb3f98d6216dfb059846bb1ba0361ab"}, :square {:schema :wm/three-halve