mission state machine:\n\n    ```\n    :greenfield → :scoped → :active → :blocked → :review → :done\n                     ↑          ↓         ↓\n                     └──────────┴─────────┘ (can regress)\n    ```\n\n    State definitions:\n    - :greenfield - Idea captured, no work plan\n    - :scoped - Success criteria, boundaries, dependencies defined\n    - :active - Work in progress, owner assigned\n    - :blocked - Waiting on dependency (cite blocker)\n    - :review - Work complete, awaiting verification\n    - :done - Success criteria met, evidence recorded\n\n    Transition requirements:\n    - greenfield → scoped: Mission doc has success criteria + scope\n    - scoped → active: Owner assigned, dependencies clear\n    - active → blocked: Blocker cited with link to blocking mission\n    - active → review: All success criteria addressed\n    - review → done: Evidence verified by reviewer\n    - Any → :abandoned: Explicit decision with rationale\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/futon-theory/mission-lifecycle.flexiarg", :sha256 "78eee0c50b9af03f21a6225c21799b5c724ae873dfd95aee9724be5aac787001"}, :situation-source "Combined lifecycle pattern and mission status.", :theory {:elems #{:b}, :names {:b "An auditable DERIVE-stage mission whose next transition depends on recorded binding evidence."}, :axioms #{}}}}, :maps {:a1 #{[:g :i1]}, :a2 #{[:g :i2]}, :b1 #{[:i1 :b]}, :b2 #{[:i2 :b]}}, :auxiliary {:b1 false, :b2 false}}} {:occurrence-id ["agent/handoff-preserves-context" 2], :pattern "agent/handoff-preserves-context", :roles ["context" "dependency"], :fragment-indices [], :origin :selected, :provenance {:reading-record-id "M-recommendation-bindings/M-recommendation-bindings/policy-7e8a0806fea29fa47914/[\"agent/handoff-preserves-context\" 2]", :span {:start 160, :end 225}, :source-text-digest "e8678feb63133e7a13d5d3ed7a2722c430f8ff80f2355b6f98a4d09dd01fe941", :analysis-digest "54558739922fa7db94f035fc7573d430033fbee7e87acce089da6b5f4ed38441", :source-sha256 "403a43dfe0b4ae903c1e7ca249ffe8b43715b998b27262f75b3168028a0f3bb3", :square-digest "c9775f00d451cc052caa5d8d2db0b9d0760e9fb097b35cfa27f90ad1b6a950b2"}, :square {:schema :wm/three-halves-square-v1, :pattern "agent/handoff-preserves-context", :objects {:G {:text "    Handoffs convert ephemeral session state into persistent project state. They enable distributed and asynchronous work without context collapse.\n\n    + evidence: Fulab exports session context to `lab/raw`, `lab/stubs`, and `lab/trace` (`dev/lab-export-claude.clj`), plus summaries via `fulab-summary` and `fulab-session-report`.\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/agent/handoff-preserves-context.flexiarg", :sha256 "403a43dfe0b4ae903c1e7ca249ffe8b43715b998b27262f75b3168028a0f3bb3"}, :situation-source "Pattern handoff requirements applied to the named conversation provenance.", :theory {:elems #{:g}, :names {:g "Evaluate a cascade by whether it preserves the War Bulletin context through binding decisions, evidence anchors, and follow-on actions."}, :axioms #{}}}, :I1 {:text "    Continuity matters: the work is incremental, context is expensive to rebuild, or progress would be lost.\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/agent/handoff-preserves-context.flexiarg", :sha256 "403a43dfe0b4ae903c1e7ca249ffe8b43715b998b27262f75b3168028a0f3bb3"}, :situation-source "agent/handoff-preserves-context IF/THEN handoff contract.", :theory {:elems #{:i1}, :names {:i1 "Incremental work requires a durable handoff containing decisions, boundaries, next actions, and evidence anchors."}, :axioms #{}}}, :I2 {:text "    Without explicit handoff, successors face cold starts: they repeat discoveries, miss constraints, or contradict prior decisions.\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/agent/handoff-preserves-context.flexiarg", :sha256 "403a43dfe0b4ae903c1e7ca249ffe8b43715b998b27262f75b3168028a0f3bb3"}, :situation-source "M-recommendation-bindings owner fragment.", :theory {:elems #{:i2}, :names {:i2 "Joe and an agent own this mission after a War Bulletin 8 conversation handoff."}, :axioms #{}}}, :B {:text "    Define a handoff record that captures: current state hypothesis, decisions made and why, open questions, scope boundaries, next actions, evidence/trail anchors, and any provisional-claim ledger. Emit it at session end or when transferring to another agent.\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/agent/handoff-preserves-context.flexiarg", :sha256 "403a43dfe0b4ae903c1e7ca249ffe8b43715b998b27262f75b3168028a0f3bb3"}, :situation-source "Combined handoff pattern and owner field.", :theory {:elems #{:b}, :names {:b "A recommendation-binding mission that successors can continue without reconstructing the originating conversation."}, :axioms #{}}}}, :maps {:a1 #{[:g :i1]}, :a2 #{[:g :i2]}, :b1 #{[:i1 :b]}, :b2 #{[:i2 :b]}}, :auxiliary {:b1 false, :b2 false}}} {:occurrence-id ["agent/evidence-over-assertion" 3], :pattern "agent/evidence-over-assertion", :roles ["dependency" "context"], :fragment-indices [], :origin :selected, :provenance {:reading-record-id "M-recommendation-bindings/M-recommendation-bindings/policy-7e8a0806fea29fa47914/[\"agent/evidence-over-assertion\" 3]", :span {:start 242, :end 319}, :source-text-digest "e8678feb63133e7a13d5d3ed7a2722c430f8ff80f2355b6f98a4d09dd01fe941", :analysis-digest "54558739922fa7db94f035fc7573d430033fbee7e87acce089da6b5f4ed38441", :source-sha256 "28425a05c4a87cbfe3147c1998e83701b8519b42c1796f1d0f25b4b039271248", :square-digest "bb6eec099f82881e44b1c51b8d079287679af839303eace15323614a20368b22"}, :square {:schema :wm/three-halves-square-v1, :pattern "agent/evidence-over-assertion", :objects {:G {:text "    Evidence transforms agent output from \"trust me\" to \"check this.\" It enables verification, correction, and cumulative trust-building.\n\n    + evidence: Fulab PUR/PSR templates require anchors/certificates (`src/futon3/fulab/pattern_competence.clj`), and claim verification is enforced via `fulab-pattern-claim` + `fulab-pattern-check`.\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/